      "side": 1,
      "message": "I originally considered that, and remember having some conversation during or before review, though I cannot find it.\n\nAs far as I recall, there were issues, possibly lack of ability to switch between push/pull and open drain without touching the high/low output value or changing the pullup settings.\n\nMy conclusion was that what was provided by CONFIG_CMD_GPIO_EXTENDED could not be used to implement the OpenTitan tool interface that I need to:\nhttps://github.com/lowRISC/opentitan/blob/master/sw/host/opentitanlib/src/io/gpio.rs#L62",
